description = "Plants a replication seed in the nearby non-REPL\\K8R ally with the lowest health. It hatches after 8 seconds, or when that ally dies, into a REPLK4NT beside it. The longer it gestates, the more health the REPLK4NT starts with (30% at once, up to full)."
